# LeafBus ESP-IDF settings, applied after the stock ESP32_GENERIC ones.
#
# Deliberately empty: the network settings tried with 26 panels made things
# worse, so ESP-IDF's defaults stay.
#   TCP_SND_BUF / TCP_WND 5760 -> 2880, no AMPDU TX, fewer Wi-Fi buffers:
#     9 kB more free heap, but transfers slowed: 12-14 failed requests under
#     heavy load (stock: 3-7)
#   STATIC_RX_BUFFER_NUM 10 -> 6, RX_BA_WIN 6 -> 4, DYNAMIC_RX/TX 32 -> 16:
#     select() failed with EIO even under light load
#   ESP_WIFI_SOFTAP_SUPPORT=n: saves ~1 kB (136 B static), and the board can
#     no longer open its set-up access point; not worth it
